claude Bot
30 minutes ago
The inline payload type here duplicates CreateExtractionProjectRequest from @ardoq/api-types, which is the exact same shape ({ name: string; workspaceId: ArdoqId }) and is what the routine ultimately passes to extractionProjectApi.create. Reusing the shared type keeps the action payload and the request body in sync if the request contract changes.

Suggested change
export const createExtractionProject = actionCreator<{
  name: string;
  workspaceId: ArdoqId;
}>('[entityExtraction] CREATE_EXTRACTION_PROJECT');
export const createExtractionProject =
  actionCreator<CreateExtractionProjectRequest>(
    '[entityExtraction] CREATE_EXTRACTION_PROJECT'
  );

